 self-explanatory. These tags make documenting `true`, `false` and `null` much less painful for how common they are utilised, preventing [errors](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95762) and speeding up writing ever so slightly. Documentation comments can also benefit from these. \r\n\r\nCompared to code tags, this PR also displays these tags slightly differently. As an example, Node's documentation has been modified to use the new tags.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1548efe5-8109-4aeb-a75c-650507f22da9)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**A massive replacement is NOT an option**, unless another PR does something [drastic](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89819) that warrants it somehow.\r\n\r\n\r\n--- \r\nGiven reception on the proposal is not particularly excellent, I doubt this will ever be merged, but it was worth getting it off my chest.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.c